\pard\sa160\b\fs32 Subtitle Converter\b0\fs20\par
\pard\sa160 Subtitle Converter is a lightweight, fully offline desktop tool that converts text subtitle files between SRT, WebVTT, LRC, ASS, SSA and SBV. All processing happens on this computer: the application has no network code and never uploads, collects or transmits your subtitle files.\par
\pard\sa120\b Third-party components\b0\par
\pard\fi-284\li284\sa80 This application is built with Flutter and uses a small number of open-source Dart packages. Each component is covered by its own licence. The complete licence texts are installed with the application in \cf1 data\\flutter_assets\\NOTICES.Z\cf0 , and are also available from each project's repository.\par
\pard\sa120\b Warranty\b0\par
\pard\sa160 This software is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement. In no event shall the authors be liable for any claim, damages or other liability arising from, out of or in connection with the software or its use.\par
\pard\sa160 You are responsible for keeping backups of your subtitle files. The installer never modifies your source files, and converted files are written alongside them (or into a folder you choose) with automatic renaming instead of overwriting.\par
